sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant API as API Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>TCP
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>TCP
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Proc as Batch Processor<br/>9090/TCP (obs)
    participant IGW as llm-d Inference<br/>Gateway HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GC as Garbage Collector<br/>9091/TCP (obs)

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Batch Job Submission

    Client->>API: POST /v1/files (multipart)<br/>Header: X-MaaS-Username<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    API->>S3: Store input file<br/>AWS credentials
    API->>PG: Insert file metadata<br/>Connection URL
    API-->>Client: 200 File ID

    Client->>API: POST /v1/batches<br/>Header: X-MaaS-Username<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+
    API->>PG: Insert batch metadata<br/>Connection URL
    API->>Redis: PQEnqueue (priority queue)<br/>Optional TLS
    API-->>Client: 200 Batch ID

    Note over Proc,S3: Flow 2: Batch Job Processing

    loop Poll for jobs
        Proc->>Redis: PQDequeue (blocking)<br/>Optional TLS
    end
    Redis-->>Proc: Job ID
    Proc->>PG: DBGet (job metadata)<br/>Connection URL
    PG-->>Proc: Batch job details

    Proc->>S3: Retrieve input file<br/>AWS credentials
    S3-->>Proc: Input JSONL

    loop Per inference request (AIMD concurrency)
        Proc->>IGW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Optional TLS 1.2+ / mTLS<br/>API key (optional)
        IGW-->>Proc: Inference result
    end

    Proc->>S3: Store output file<br/>AWS credentials
    Proc->>PG: DBUpdate CAS (completed)<br/>Connection URL
    Proc->>Redis: Update status TTL

    Note over GC,S3: Flow 3: Garbage Collection

    loop Every 30m (configurable)
        GC->>PG: Query expired batches/files
        PG-->>GC: Expired resources
        GC->>S3: Delete physical files<br/>AWS credentials
        GC->>PG: DBDelete expired records
    end

    Note over GC,Redis: Flow 3b: Orphan Reconciliation

    loop Every 60m (configurable)
        GC->>PG: Query non-terminal jobs
        PG-->>GC: Stale jobs
        GC->>Redis: InFlightGetAll, PQGetIDs<br/>Check active processors
        Redis-->>GC: Active job tracking
        GC->>PG: DBUpdate CAS<br/>Re-enqueue or fail orphans
    end
